        <p><strong>Date:</strong> November 1-8, 2025</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Submit your project idea and team details through the registration form</li>
          <li>Include problem statement, proposed solution, and expected impact</li>
          <li>Our panel will review all submissions and select qualified teams</li>
          <li>Selected teams will be notified by November 10, 2025</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="round">
        <div class="round-number">Round 2</div>
